{
  "$schema": "../../../schemas/policy.schema.json",
  "comment": [
    "New Settings Catalog policy (no live example to adopt): additively adds CaC-Tier-Teen",
    "members to local Administrators on any Windows device they self-enroll. Same CSP shape",
    "as local-admin-adult-all-device-tiers.json, swapping the member SID for CaC-Tier-Teen",
    "(group id 0b6f1bf2-882b-4b60-a857-6e539d2b0b4f, AAD-encoded SID",
    "S-1-12-1-191831026-1264617515-1399740328-1326132125).",
    "Assignment: include sg-devices-teen and sg-devices-child (teens get admin on their own",
    "tier plus the child device pool), explicitly EXCLUDE sg-devices-adult (must not inherit",
    "adult-machine admin) and sg-breakglass (defense in depth).",
    "Confirmation gaps (per Morpheus's design, unresolved, same as the adult policy): exact",
    "settingDefinitionId strings and Add-vs-Replace actiontype semantics were only verified",
    "against the live 'SF Adults Local Admin' policy, not against a freshly-created teen-scoped",
    "instance; user-vs-device assignment targeting for this device-scoped CSP has not been",
    "live-verified either. See .squad/decisions/inbox/morpheus-teen-local-admin-and-device-prep-design.md."
  ],
  "name": "local-admin-teen",
  "resource": "deviceManagementConfigurationPolicies",
  "assignments": [
    { "group": "sg-devices-teen", "intent": "include" },
    { "group": "sg-devices-child", "intent": "include" },
    { "group": "sg-devices-adult", "intent": "exclude" },
    { "group": "sg-breakglass", "intent": "exclude" }
  ],
